  </p>
  <p class="built">No ads. No accounts.</p>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    margin: 18px 0 4px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .built {
    color: var(--sub);
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    margin: 10px 0 0;
  }
</style>
